WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.317
Start links show you which ad or post brought each subscriber to your bot.

2
00:00:08.618 --> 00:00:10.750
Give every ad its own link.

3
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.665
Type a name, like tiktok_ad6, and tap Create link.

4
00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:17.269
It's copied, ready for your ad.

5
00:00:17.399 --> 00:00:21.131
Everyone who starts your bot through it is tagged with that name.

6
00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:24.565
Here you see how many people each link brought in.

7
00:00:24.695 --> 00:00:27.605
The meta_ad14 link is doing best.

8
00:00:27.905 --> 00:00:29.888
Now open Audiences.

9
00:00:30.018 --> 00:00:33.691
An audience is a saved group of your bot subscribers.

10
00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.316
Give it a name, then add a rule.

11
00:00:36.446 --> 00:00:39.778
Let's pick everyone who came from the Meta ad link.

12
00:00:40.077 --> 00:00:43.484
The live count shows how many people match right now.

13
00:00:43.614 --> 00:00:47.388
You can add more rules, like clicked in the last 7 days.

14
00:00:47.689 --> 00:00:48.962
Save it.

15
00:00:49.092 --> 00:00:53.448
Then tap Message them, or pick this audience when you send a message.

16
00:00:53.747 --> 00:00:56.946
Audiences are for people who started your bot.

17
00:00:57.076 --> 00:01:00.728
A channel or group post always reaches everyone in it.

18
00:01:00.858 --> 00:01:04.627
Audiences and start links come with the Growth plan and up.
